{"path":"io/basic_filebuf/operator=","title":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_filebuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/operator=","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns another basic_filebuf object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf\"><span class=\"kw1684\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_filebuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf\"><span class=\"kw1684\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_filebuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf\"><span class=\"kw1684\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_filebuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf\"><span class=\"kw1684\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_filebuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns another <code>basic_filebuf</code> object.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> First calls <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/close\">close()</a></span> to close the associated file, then moves the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>: the put and get buffers, the associated file, the locale, the openmode, the is_open flag, and any other state. After the move, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> is not associated with a file and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The copy assignment operator is deleted; <code>basic_filebuf</code> is not <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CopyAssignable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CopyAssignable</em></a>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>basic_filebuf</code> that will be moved from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\"><span class=\"kw1750\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ofstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"test.in\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"test<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// writes via a temporary object</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ifstream\"><span class=\"kw1749\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ifstream</span></span></a> fin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"test.in\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// read-only stream</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\"><span class=\"kw1750\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ofstream</span></span></a> fout<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"test.out\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// write-only stream</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/getline\"><span class=\"kw1264\">std::<span class=\"me2\">getline</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fin, s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"s = [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// s contains \"test\"</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fout.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fin.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fout.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>fout.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/getline\"><span class=\"kw1264\">std::<span class=\"me2\">getline</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fin, s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"s = [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// s is empty input</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>s = [test]\ns = []</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/basic_filebuf\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a <code>basic_filebuf</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps two <code>basic_filebuf</code> objects <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_filebuf","title":"std::basic_filebuf"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Assigns another basic_filebuf object."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a basic_filebuf object"},{"label":"swap","note":"swaps two basic_filebuf objects"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":190,"codeBlockCount":2}
